@startuml
' AD-028; source ../use-cases/UC-028-preview-generic-model-try-on.md
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; approved PR #4 / DD-007 scope, not implementation.
' Trace: FEAT-TRY-001; BR-028; CAP-13; PBI-045; US-TRY-001 AC.
' SRS: FR-TRY-001, FR-TRY-002, FR-TRY-003, FR-TRY-004, FR-TRY-005; DATA-TRY-001.
' Business Rules: BRULE-TRY-001/002; BRULE-COM-002; BRULE-WEAR-001/002; BRULE-AUTH-001/007.
' Open policy: MVP-Q02, MVP-Q04, MVP-Q05, MVP-Q09; PRD Section 34.2. No provider / owner allocation selected.
title AD-028 - Preview a selected look on a generic model
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Deliberately start UC-028;
|CapsuleAI|
if (Source / affected-user access authorized?) then (Yes)
  :Identify intended source and user context;
else (Denied / unusable)
  :Explain access state; disclose no private data;
  :Offer renewed access or accessible source;
  stop
endif
|CapsuleAI|
:Retain selected outfit basis and owned / unowned meaning;
:Request preview with approved minimal input;
if (Preview available for this basis?) then (Yes)
  :Show selected outfit on generic model with limitations;
else (Failed / unavailable)
  :Retain selection; explain actual state;
  :Offer retry / return; no fabricated preview;
  stop
endif
|User|
switch (Choose next action?)
case (Save look)
  |CapsuleAI|
  :Apply approved saved-look policy;
case (Wear Today)
  |CapsuleAI|
  if (Current valid owned outfit established?) then (Yes)
    :Use UC-014 logical Wear action and retry identity;
  else (No)
    :Explain prerequisite; retain selected look;
    :Create no ownership or Wear Event;
  endif
case (Return)
  :Retain independent product use;
endswitch
note right
  No selfie / personal avatar or AR / 3D.
  Preview is no guarantee of fit, suitability or wear.
end note

stop
@enduml
